    "definition_raw": "Source Advanced Class Origins pg. 27\nNo one is prepared for how hard you strike until they see it firsthand.\n\nPrerequisites: Str 13, Power Attack, base attack bonus +1, sneak attack class feature.\n\nBenefit: If you use Power Attack with the first melee attack you make during a surprise round, you can sneak attack even if you are not flanking your target and it’s not denied its Dexterity bonus to AC.",
